{
  "title": { "zh": "竖纹", "en": "Vertical streaks" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "机器人拍下的单据上满是一道道竖纹：相机传感器三列一组轮流读数，组里三列的灵敏度各不相同。现在手上只有平移、四则运算和常数，先把竖纹压下去。<wiki-ref to=\"pixel\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "The robot’s photos of documents are full of vertical streaks: the camera’s sensor reads its columns in groups of three, and the three differ in sensitivity. All you have are shifting, arithmetic and constants; flatten the streaks first. <wiki-ref to=\"pixel\"></wiki-ref>"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "每格和它的左右邻居平均，三列一组的偏差加起来正好抵消。这就是<wiki-ref to=\"neighbourhood-average\"></wiki-ref>。",
    "en": "Averaging each cell with its left and right neighbours takes in one of each of the three columns, and their errors cancel. This is a <wiki-ref to=\"neighbourhood-average\"></wiki-ref>."
  },
  "builds": {
    "type": "line3",
    "name": { "zh": "三点平均", "en": "Three-point average" },
    "desc": {
      "zh": "每格和它前后两格平均。方向可以选横或竖。",
      "en": "Each cell averaged with the two beside it, across or down."
    },
    "settings": ["axis", "outside"],
    "defaults": { "axis": "x", "outside": "clamp" }
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "streaks",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "让输出和目标一样：竖纹压平，纸和字还在。",
        "en": "Match the target: streaks flattened, paper and text still there."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "一格自己的读数里混着它那一列的偏差。左右两格的偏差和它不一样。",
          "en": "A cell’s reading carries its column’s error. The cells beside it carry different errors."
        },
        {
          "zh": "平移把整张图挪一格：挪完以后，每格上放的是它旁边那一格的读数。",
          "en": "Shifting moves the whole picture one cell: afterwards each cell holds its neighbour’s reading."
        }
      ],
      "adds": ["shift", "arithmetic", "const"],
      "configurations": {
        "shift.axis": ["x"],
        "shift.by": ["forward", "backward"],
        "*.outside": ["clamp"],
        "arithmetic.op": ["add", "div"],
        "const.kind": ["scalar"]
      },
      "inputs": [{ "name": "photo", "label": { "zh": "照片", "en": "Photo" } }],
      "outputs": [{ "name": "out", "label": { "zh": "去掉竖纹", "en": "Streaks removed" } }],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "photo": [
              [0.23, 0.05, 0.17, 0.23, 0.05, 0.17, 0.23],
              [0.23, 0.75, 0.87, 0.93, 0.75, 0.87, 0.23],
              [0.23, 0.75, 0.32, 0.38, 0.75, 0.87, 0.23],
              [0.23, 0.75, 0.87, 0.93, 0.75, 0.87, 0.23],
              [0.23, 0.05, 0.17, 0.23, 0.05, 0.17, 0.23]
            ]
          },
          "expect": {
            "out": [
              [
                0.17,
                0.15000000000000002,
                0.15000000000000002,
                0.15,
                0.15000000000000002,
                0.15000000000000002,
                0.21
              ],
              [
                0.4033333333333333,
                0.6166666666666667,
                0.8500000000000001,
                0.85,
                0.8500000000000001,
                0.6166666666666667,
                0.44333333333333336
              ],
              [
                0.4033333333333333,
                0.43333333333333335,
                0.4833333333333334,
                0.48333333333333334,
                0.6666666666666666,
                0.6166666666666667,
                0.44333333333333336
              ],
              [
                0.4033333333333333,
                0.6166666666666667,
                0.8500000000000001,
                0.85,
                0.8500000000000001,
                0.6166666666666667,
                0.44333333333333336
              ],
              [
                0.17,
                0.15000000000000002,
                0.15000000000000002,
                0.15,
                0.15000000000000002,
                0.15000000000000002,
                0.21
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": { "photo": [[0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5], [0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5], [0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5]] },
          "expect": { "out": [[0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5], [0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5], [0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5]] }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "photo": [
              [0.45, 0.56, 0.92, 0.47, 0.51],
              [0.59, 0.18, 0.51, 0.63, 0.79],
              [0.09, 0.3, 0.09, 0.81, 0.69]
            ]
          },
          "expect": {
            "out": [
              [
                0.4866666666666667,
                0.6433333333333333,
                0.6499999999999999,
                0.6333333333333333,
                0.49666666666666665
              ],
              [
                0.4533333333333333,
                0.42666666666666664,
                0.43999999999999995,
                0.6433333333333333,
                0.7366666666666666
              ],
              [0.15999999999999998, 0.16, 0.4, 0.53, 0.73]
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "r = shift[axis=x,by=forward](photo)",
        "l = shift[axis=x,by=backward](photo)",
        "s1 = arithmetic[op=add](photo,r)",
        "s2 = arithmetic[op=add](s1,l)",
        "three = const[value=3]()",
        "m = arithmetic[op=div](s2,three)",
        "out <- m"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "r = shift[axis=x,by=forward](photo)",
        "s = arithmetic[op=add](photo,r)",
        "two = const[value=2]()",
        "m = arithmetic[op=div](s,two)",
        "out <- m"
      ],
      "naiveWhy": {
        "zh": "只和一边的邻居平均，整张图往那一边偏了半格：台阶的两侧不对称。",
        "en": "Averaging with one neighbour only shifts the picture half a cell that way: each step comes out lopsided."
      },
      "sample": {
        "inputs": {
          "photo": {
            "size": [48, 36],
            "base": 0.15,
            "layers": [
              {
                "shape": "quad",
                "corners": [[5.76, 3.6], [43.2, 5.76], [41.28, 33.120000000000005], [3.84, 30.96]],
                "v": 0.85
              },
              { "shape": "text", "v": 0.3, "gap": 4, "seed": 3, "x": 9, "y": 9, "w": 26, "h": 18 }
            ],
            "noise": { "seed": 4, "amp": 0.15, "kind": "columns", "period": 3 }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
